BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Gabriel Rutledge Is Back In The Attic!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260828T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260828T210000
UID:bat-202608281900-gabriel-rutledge-is-back-in-the-attic-@bloomingtonart
 s.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Gabriel Rutledge is a fast-talking stand-up comedian and wi
 nner of both the Seattle International Comedy Competition and Atlanta’s 
 Laughing Skull Comedy Festival. He’s appeared on Comedy Central\, FOX\, 
 and Amazon Prime\, and his specials A Third of the Room and Nectarine have
  earned millions of online views.
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic
URL:https://www.comedyattic.com/events/133331
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
