BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nimrods - A Green Day Comedy (2026)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260903T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260903T210000
UID:bat-202609031900-nimrods-a-green-day-comedy-2026-@bloomingtonarts.toda
 y
DESCRIPTION:$. Nimrods is a coming-of-age comedy road trip movie inspired 
 by Green Day‘s early DIY touring days before they broke out with Dookie.
  It follows three Kansas City teenagers who race to Los Angeles for what t
 hey believe is their big break.
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater
URL:https://buskirkchumley.org/events/nimrods-a-green-day-comedy-2026-sept
 ember-3-2026/#buybuy
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Heist
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260903T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260903T213000
UID:bat-202609031930-heist@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. A band of criminals\, torn apart by suspicion and betrayal\
 , reunites for one last job. The target: a multi-million dollar ruby owned
  by an international jewel thief. When the plan goes sideways\, they slowl
 y realize that when stealing from a thief\, there are no rules.
LOCATION:Waldron Auditorium @ Waldron Arts Center
URL:https://seeconstellation.org/mainstage/heist/
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Solo Mio (2026)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260904T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260904T210000
UID:bat-202609041900-solo-mio-2026-@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. A wedding disaster leaves a groom (Kevin James) stranded in
  Rome\, heartbroken in the world’s happiest city. However\, with help fr
 om a determined local and a few meddling couples\, his ruined honeymoon be
 comes an adventure that he never expected.
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater
URL:https://buskirkchumley.org/events/solo-mio-2026-september-4-2026/
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
